a:9:{s:17:"about_description";s:861:"HENAN WEIHUA CO., LTD., founded in 1988, is a large-scale equipment manufacturing enterprise specializing in the development of overhead crane, gantry crane, port container crane, electric hoist, metallurgical crane,multifunctional crane and other products. We has 10 series of more than 200 categories of lifting machinery manufacturing qualifications. The leading products are widely used in machinery, metallurgy, mining, electric power,railway, port, petroleum, chemical and other industries, serving the national key projects such as West-east gas transmission, South-north water Diversion project, Olympic Games project, Hangzhou Bay Cross-sea Bridge and thousands of large enterprises such as china Coal, china shenhua, sinopec, petrochina, Baowu lron and Steel. And exported to Thailand,Malaysia, Australia and other more than 170 countries and regions.";s:9:"about_img";s:52:"admin/20260514/5558cfbf38e09a4e27974655d0044685.webp";s:18:"choose_description";s:687:"In modern industrial development worldwide, smooth and efficient material handling and cargo movement play a vital role in daily production operations. A durable and well-built lifting equipment is essential to streamline your workflow. As a professional crane manufacturer based in China, WEIHUA has earned wide recognition and solid trust across the industry. Whether you plan to procure standard lifting machinery or look for tailored lifting solutions, we are fully capable of meeting all your practical demands. We offer customized manufacturing services covering overhead cranes, gantry cranes, container handling cranes, RTG cranes, RMG cranes and various other lifting equipment.";s:6:"choose";a:6:{i:0;a:4:{s:11:"choose_name";s:11:"Direct Deal";s:11:"choose_desc";s:65:"Weihua Crane is a real factory to help youeffectively save costs.";s:12:"choose_image";s:51:"admin/20241227/64c9b433b999588924fb5befa6c333b9.png";s:19:"choose_image_active";s:51:"admin/20241227/9eac08b8e263bc41b951db6374925f5c.png";}i:1;a:4:{s:11:"choose_name";s:20:"Complete Certificate";s:11:"choose_desc";s:128:"Weihua Crane has obtained ISO and OHSAS certification, products CCS, ABS etc certification, and special QC checks for shipments.";s:12:"choose_image";s:52:"admin/20241227/c7b2db26dd7bceb55294605397d45154.webp";s:19:"choose_image_active";s:51:"admin/20241227/f86758167663bae45d01cf6f12b03275.png";}i:2;a:4:{s:11:"choose_name";s:30:"Professional Technical Support";s:11:"choose_desc";s:107:"The technicians have abundant project experience, and will provide you with professional technical support.";s:12:"choose_image";s:51:"admin/20241227/156f6238d94bd6e5049e1ec9b5cdab09.png";s:19:"choose_image_active";s:51:"admin/20241227/ac5f65e9f9faf559d5bdfbbbbb7cda43.png";}i:3;a:4:{s:11:"choose_name";s:29:"Complete Production Equipment";s:11:"choose_desc";s:85:"Complete production equipment, reflecting the processing quality and cost advantages.";s:12:"choose_image";s:51:"admin/20241227/6d29b256371f64b842adb13090f00b02.png";s:19:"choose_image_active";s:51:"admin/20241227/323eaf09d62f34d18d6cb23fa5e8793e.png";}i:4;a:4:{s:11:"choose_name";s:14:"Quick Response";s:11:"choose_desc";s:60:"Quick response to Pre-sale, in-sale and after-sale problems.";s:12:"choose_image";s:51:"admin/20241227/a13cdd146f86731efc8a584cc60eb738.png";s:19:"choose_image_active";s:51:"admin/20241227/266bc1a20febe7a2f427e5fef6e643c7.png";}i:5;a:4:{s:11:"choose_name";s:18:"Technical Guidance";s:11:"choose_desc";s:67:"Provide on-site technical support and follow-up technical guidance.";s:12:"choose_image";s:51:"admin/20241227/a9b3bd90aff4211fd0e2ec27f71c3f96.png";s:19:"choose_image_active";s:51:"admin/20241227/f0da3311946ce71a306869ae320de5b7.png";}}s:9:"faq_title";s:3:"FAQ";s:17:"faq_contact_title";s:27:"Can not Find Your Question?";s:16:"faq_contact_desc";s:79:"If you can not find the answer, contact us and let us know how we can help you.";s:20:"faq_contact_btn_text";s:10:"Contact Us";s:3:"faq";a:5:{i:0;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:80:"What factors affect crane prices most, and how can I get a reasonable quotation?";s:6:"answer";s:635:"Many customers worry about hidden costs and inconsistent pricing when buying cranes. The actual crane price mainly depends on lifting capacity, span, lifting height, working duty, configuration standards and customized functions. Simple standard models have stable and transparent prices, while special working conditions such as explosion-proof, high-temperature, anti-corrosion and intelligent anti-sway systems will lead to different costs. We provide one-on-one tailored quotes based on your actual site conditions and usage needs, with no hidden charges, and every configuration and cost item is clearly listed for your reference.";}i:1;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:78:"Are your cranes suitable for my local industrial and environmental conditions?";s:6:"answer";s:574:"This is the key concern for overseas buyers, as different countries have different weather, site and industry requirements. Our overhead cranes, gantry cranes and port cranes can be fully adapted to various complex environments, including high temperature, heavy rain, coastal humidity, dust and strong wind conditions. We can adjust motor brands, electrical systems, anti-rust painting standards, protection grades and wind-proof devices according to your local climate, site environment and industry standards, ensuring long-term stable operation in your working scenario.";}i:2;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:73:"Do you support customized crane solutions for special working conditions?";s:6:"answer";s:610:"Standard cranes cannot meet all project needs, which is why custom solutions are essential for industrial engineering projects. We fully support personalized customization including non-standard span, special lifting height, heavy-duty working level, explosion-proof, insulation, anti-corrosion, intelligent anti-sway, remote control and automatic positioning functions. Whether it is factory indoor handling, outdoor yard operation, port container handling or metallurgy and chemical special scenarios, we can design and produce exclusive crane equipment according to your drawings and technical requirements.";}i:3;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:60:"What certifications do your cranes have for overseas export?";s:6:"answer";s:526:"Most overseas projects require official certification for customs clearance and project acceptance, which is a major pain point for many purchasers. All our cranes are manufactured in strict accordance with international standards and have complete export qualifications, including CE, ISO and other mainstream certifications. We can provide complete certification documents, inspection reports and factory qualification materials to ensure smooth customs clearance, local inspection and long-term project use in your country.";}i:4;a:2:{s:8:"question";s:62:"What after-sales support can you provide for overseas clients?";s:6:"answer";s:567:"Overseas customers are most worried about no technical support and difficult maintenance after purchasing equipment. We provide full-cycle after-sales service including installation guidance, operation training, remote technical support and lifetime after-sales consultation. We supply original spare parts at factory prices for long-term maintenance. If you encounter operation failure, equipment debugging or daily maintenance problems, our professional technical team can respond quickly to help you solve problems and ensure the cranes run stably for a long time.";}}}